 NC.LRR..SH.0165278.npz\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  50851 Jan 25 20:43 NC.LSI..EH.0321126.npz\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 138645 Jan 25 20:43 NC.MCB..HH.0227959.npz\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  51810 Jan 25 20:43 NC.MCM.02.EH.0105613.npz\r\n-"]
